------------------------------------------------------------------------------
What this notice does NOT cover
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Apache-2.0 covers the code in this repository: the doltsamples package, the stack
it generates and the consoles' configuration. It covers no data.

This repository redistributes no sample data. `make export` reads it from a
sql-megasamples build on your own machine, and every dataset there
keeps its own upstream licence -- several are CC BY-SA and carry share-alike and
attribution obligations that Apache-2.0 does not satisfy and cannot override.
Those terms, and the attribution each dataset requires, are in that project's
LICENSES.md and NOTICE.md.

A store this project builds is a copy of that data in another engine: the
dataset's licence and attribution travel with it.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party software run by this project (not redistributed)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Dolt (https://github.com/dolthub/dolt) and DoltgreSQL
(https://github.com/dolthub/doltgresql), Apache-2.0, are run from their published
images and are not vendored or modified here. DoltLite
(https://github.com/dolthub/doltlite), Apache-2.0 over public-domain SQLite, is
installed from its release packages into an image built here, beside a sqlite3
shell built from sqlite.org's source.

The Dolt Workbench, nginx, phpMyAdmin, Adminer, DbGate and CloudBeaver are
likewise run from their published images under their own licences.
